==Description==
'''Nerd Ducky''' is an exclusive [[Stickers|sticker]] obtained from the [[Ducky Revenge Event]]. It was obtained from Level 38 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|1,360}} or {{Robux|106}} ({{Robux|90}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|24,220}} or {{Robux|3,322}} ({{Robux|2,806}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Nerd Ducky''' sticker shows the [[Nerd Duck (Story)|Nerd Duck]]'s head. It plays a sound of the [[Nerd Duck (Story)|Nerd Duck]] quacking.

